<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northern Telecom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northern Telecom started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Northern Telecom Ltd with outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 7/8 at 51 on the NYSE.</p>
